#: confusb/kb.py:17
msgid "PC/SC service and CCID drivers"
msgstr "PC/SC-þjónusta og CCID-reklar"

#: confusb/kb.py:18
msgid ""
"pcscd is the daemon that manages smart card readers; libccid provides the "
"driver for standard USB readers (CCID). Without pcscd the reader shows up in "
"USB but no application can use it."
msgstr ""
"pcscd er púkinn sem stýrir snjallkortalesurum; libccid veitir rekilinn fyrir "
"hefðbundna USB-lesara (CCID). Án pcscd birtist lesarinn í USB en ekkert "
"forrit getur notað hann."

#: confusb/kb.py:22
msgid "OpenSC (PKCS#11, supports DNIe and other cards)"
msgstr "OpenSC (PKCS#11, styður DNIe og önnur kort)"

#: confusb/kb.py:23
msgid ""
"Library and tools for cryptographic cards. It includes support for the DNIe "
"(3.0/4.0) and the PKCS#11 module used by Firefox/Chromium and AutoFirma. "
"Older DNIe cards (2.0) may need the official DNIe module."
msgstr ""
"Safn og verkfæri fyrir dulritunarkort. Inniheldur stuðning við DNIe "
"(3.0/4.0) og PKCS#11-einingu sem Firefox/Chromium og AutoFirma nota. Eldri "
"DNIe (2.0) gætu þurft opinberu DNIe-eininguna."

#: confusb/kb.py:26
msgid "List readers"
msgstr "Birta lesara"

